      201.55,
      397.34,
      249.21
    ],
    "text": "(b)to organize and promote research in this field andundertake studies and research projects on contractfrom government, private and international agenciesany institutions;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
