  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      395.47,
      397.38,
      431.61
    ],
    "text": "(f)to promote understanding cooperation andfriendship with similar associations within andoutside the country;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      441.07,
      397.48,
      500.01
    ],
    "text": "(g)to undertake, promote and conduct on its owninitiative or in collaboration with local or foreignassociations such surveys and studies on economicand social development in Sri Lanka or any otherregion of the world;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      509.47,
      397.05,
      534.21
    ],
    "text": "(h)to engage in any activity connected with orincidental to, the above objectives.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      543.67,
      397.24,
      568.41
    ],
    "text": "4. Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      577.87,
      396.94,
      602.61
    ],
    "text": "(a)raise funds and receive grants, gifts or donations, incash or kind;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      612.07,
      397.33,
      671.49
    ],
    "text": "(b)acquire, in any manner whatsoever and hold, takeor give on lease or hire, sell or otherwise dispose of,any movable or immovable property and construct,maintain and alter any buildings or works necessaryor convenient for the business of the Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      546.5,
      451.16,
      566.77
    ],
