    ],
    "text": "(3) The members of the Corporation shall be subject tothe rules in force for the time being of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      235.87,
      401.68,
      272.01
    ],
    "text": "8.(1) The Corporation shall cause proper books ofaccounts to be kept of the income and expenditure, assetsand liabilities and all other transactions of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      281.47,
      401.66,
      306.21
    ],
    "text": "(2) The accounts of the Corporation shall be examinedand audited at least once in every year.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      315.67,
      402.02,
      374.61
    ],
    "text": "9.(1) With effect from the date of commencement ofthis Act (in this section referred to as \u201cthe relevant date\u201d),the undertaking of the Association shall vest absolutely inthe Corporation. For the purposes of this section, \u201ctheundertaking of the Association\u201d means\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      384.07,
      401.83,
      408.81
    ],
    "text": "(a)all property, movable or immovable, of theAssociation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      418.27,
      402.02,
      454.41
    ],
    "text": "(b)all rights, powers, privileges and interests of theAssociation and all the liabilities of theAssociation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      463.87,
      401.91,
      488.61
    ],
    "text": "(c)all books, accounts and documents of theAssociation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      498.07,
      401.58,
      511.41
    ],
    "text": "(2) Without prejudice to the generality of subsection (1)\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      520.87,
      401.88,
      557.01
    ],
    "text": "(a)all property, movable or immovable, owned by theAssociation shall vest, with effect from the relevantdate, in the Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      566.47,
      402.0,
      614.01
    ],
    "text": "(b)all debts due to and subscriptions and fees payableto the Association on the day immediatelypreceding the relevant date shall be paid to theCorporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      623.47,
      402.25,
      672.09
    ],
    "text": "(c)all liabilities of the Association subsisting on theday immediately preceding the relevant date shall,with effect from the relevant date, be deemed to bethe liabilities of the Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
