      201.67,
      397.55,
      251.97
    ],
    "text": "(d)all officers and servants of the Association on theday immediately preceding the relevant date shall,with effect from the relevant date, be deemed to beofficers and servants of the Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
