  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      201.55,
      402.22,
      262.89
    ],
    "text": "12.No member of the Corporation shall, for the purposeof discharging the debts and liabilities of the Corporation orfor any other purpose, be liable to make any contributionexceeding the amount of annual subscription payable byhim to the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      273.55,
      402.38,
      406.89
    ],
    "text": "13.If upon the dissolution of the Corporation thereremains after the satisfaction of all its debts and liabilities,any property whatsoever, such property shall not bedistributed among the members of the Corporation, but shallbe given or transferred to any other Institute or Institutionshaving objects similar to those of the Corporation, and whichis or are by the rules thereof prohibited from distributingany income or property among its or their members. SuchInstitute or Institutions shall be determined by the membersof the Corporation at or immediately before the dissolutionof the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      417.55,
      401.83,
      478.89
    ],
    "text": "14.Nothing in this Act contained shall prejudice oraffect the rights of the Republic or of any body politic orcorporate or of any other persons, except such as arementioned in this Act and those claiming by, from or underthem.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      489.55,
      402.18,
      526.89
    ],
    "text": "15.In the event of any inconsistency between theSinhala and the Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shallprevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 7,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
